{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/45460-historical-settings-for-hunter","id":45460,"title":"Historical Settings for Hunter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-09T02:38:47-08:00","id":45460,"title":"Historical Settings for Hunter?","content":"I've thrown myself into the oWoD lately, and have been greatly enjoying the Dark Ages line of books. Between that and the impending release of<i> Dark Eras</i>, I've had historical settings on the mind. While hardly organized, there's enough to work with to figure out how a <i>Vigil For Rome </i>would look (Aves Minerva, Aegis Kai Doru, and early Ascending Ones standing against the Kindred of Rome, barbarian Werewolves, and stranger things still from the East; thumb through <i>Cthulhu Invictus</i> a few times for help), and we have a Salem Witch Trial <i>Dark Era</i> on the way, if memory stands.<br /> <br /> What other time periods would you like to see?<br /> <br /> I think I'd like to see WW2 the most (either a gonzo pulp take on things, or a Delta Green approach; either way, we get the Nazi sorcerers we all crave, which may well manifest in a Loyalists of Thule as a Tier 3 group), though my preference comes largely from familiarity; it's my historical expertise, and only then by a slim margin. Pre-modern, international settings are the ideal; breaking away from the groups we know best and really shaking things up in terms of who we see and what they fight. If a setting touches the Middle East, I'd like to see djinn get some attention as a breed of monster.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T04:52:04-08:00","id":45501,"title":"","content":"Hm. I was thinking the other day how a Wild West game with Hunter might be fun. A WW2 setting could be cool too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/196-max-deltree","name":"Max Deltree","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar196_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T05:43:48-08:00","id":45525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> which may well manifest in a Loyalists of Thule as a Tier 3 group </div> </div> </div>I don't see it. They're the loyalists of <b>Thule</b>, not the Nazis, that's their entire point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T05:58:54-08:00","id":45533,"title":"","content":"The Vietnam War is goofy and bizarre enough to work perfectly for this kind of thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T06:41:03-08:00","id":45546,"title":"","content":"American Civil War.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T07:49:49-08:00","id":45586,"title":"","content":"Middle east, 4000BC.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T10:26:35-08:00","id":45697,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see the Byzantine Empire right on the cusp of the crusades.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T13:55:49-08:00","id":45834,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Kunoichi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/45460-historical-settings-for-hunter?p=45697#post45697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd like to see the Byzantine Empire right on the cusp of the crusades.</div> </div> </div> </div>Awww yeah, the Byzantine Empire is somewhat under represented in historical fiction.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-09T14:15:55-08:00","id":45845,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/45460-historical-settings-for-hunter?p=45525#post45525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I don't see it. They're the loyalists of <b>Thule</b>, not the Nazis, that's their entire point.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the point NOW - but the entire &quot;sin&quot; for which they are indebted to the world is their complicity in the rise of the Third Reich. In reality several leaders of the Nazi Party such as Rudolf Hess (Deputy Fuhrer), and Hans Frank (Governor-General of Occupied Poland) had been member of Thule Gesellschaft, and the organization actually sponsored the DAP which became the Nazi Party.<br /> <br /> The way I'd do it, a Third Tier Nazi organization rose OUT OF Thule Gesellschaft's work. When the Loyalists were born out of shame after the war, it included both some of the original Thule Society members who had not supported the direction of the Nazi Party they lost control of, and ALSO some of the Hunters (though none of the leaders) of the former Third Tier organization, which VALKYRIE and other Allie organizations ground under their boot-heel. Some others of said Hunters were recruited by VALKYRIE as part of Operation Paperclip; or disappeared with some creepy biological research on supernatural targets into the Cheiron Group.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T08:15:19-08:00","id":46267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> but the entire &quot;sin&quot; for which they are indebted to the world is their complicity in the rise of the Third Reich. </div> </div> </div>They're complicit in the formation of the party and of the ideology at a very early stage; the actual development and implementation of the Third Reich is the result of the Nazi Party itself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T18:24:52-08:00","id":46649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Michael</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/45460-historical-settings-for-hunter?p=46267#post46267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They're complicit in the formation of the party and of the ideology at a very early stage; the actual development and implementation of the Third Reich is the result of the Nazi Party itself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Several of whom were members of Thule Gessellschaft. I'm not trying to (nor did I say anything that would imply) move any responsibility off of the Nazi Party. Many many people were complicit in the rise of the Third Reich. The Nazis had a TON of national support through Germany and Austria.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T19:36:33-08:00","id":46684,"title":"","content":"What about the Ahnenerbe as those opponents instead? Or a part of them. Perhaps they were capturing immortal supernaturals and artifacts for evidence of the Aryan civilization they wanted. Atlantis might be awfully attractive as an idea for them, if they view it through the right lens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T19:55:38-08:00","id":46689,"title":"","content":"The Kharotechia was Delta Green's take on Nazi sorcerers, and was a branch of the Ahnenerbe that worked with members of the Thule Society to create occult weapons for the Third Reich. Something similar would work quite well as a foil for the Loyalists.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-10T20:12:21-08:00","id":46696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/45460-historical-settings-for-hunter?p=45546#post45546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">American Civil War.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah that or around the time of the American Revolution would be interesting for HtV.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-11T15:24:11-08:00","id":47100,"title":"","content":"There was some discussion on the old forums for WWII hunter - at least the European Theatre. It could be an enormous setting, I would personally divide it into several mini-books. Each country gets it's own theme, or two: on for the war one for the civilians.<br /> <br /> One thing I'd make clear is that mortal humans (and the Nazi top brass are all mortal humans, though not for lack of trying on the Vampires or Awakened's part) are the biggest threat. If the Nazi's develop a supernatural super-weapon it's less of a threat than a panzer devision, though probably still enough of a threat to justify sabotaging.<br /> <br /> The other thing I'd focus on is that WWI and WWII literally created the modern world. A lot of the younger Compacts/Conspiracies we see today (E.G. TFV, MI18, KSI29, Hakollel shel Hamerkava, Soci\u00e9t\u00e9 d\u2019Had\u00e8s, and of course the Loyalists of Thule) explicitly trace their origins to WWII - so there's a lot of potential in playing the younger versions of the Conspiracies and seeing how they became who we know them as today.<br /> <br /> This leads to a third point. If you look at the Cannon Hunter, despite being set in America it's actually really really European. Among the Conspiracies you have two primarally American Groups (TF:V, VASCU), two with no real HQ (Les Mysteries - possibly of African origin, Canite Herasy - originally Roman), one Egyptian (Ascending Ones) and five are European. Arguably you can bring that up to six (if you say Egypt is close enough) or seven (if you focus on the Canite's origins). I think there's a <u><b>really interesting</b></u> (seriously, this is one of my favourite hunter ideas) way to Europe's abundance of Conspiracies into culture and history.<br /> <br /> One of the core setting ideas of the WoD, which is extra relevant to Hunter, is that mortals know about the supernatural but refuse to accept that humans aren't on top of food chain. You could draw a thematic parallel to America's cultural belief that the USA is the worlds only superpower. Europe used to have beliefs like that, but the world wars practically made nationalism a dirty word in Europe. So I think it might be interesting to play WWII as the point where that self-inflicted Masquerade <i>began</i> dying in Europe, along with nationalism, religion and all those other comfortable ideas we had about our place in the cosmos.<br /> <br /> In short: During WWII both sides dredged up so much of the shadows and exposed it to the world, while simultaneously damaging ideals (faith in god, faith in country) that discouraged interaction with the supernatural; that they could never quite shove everything back into the shadows at the end. The increasing denial of the occult that started with Christianity and took off during the Renaissance went into slow decline.<br /> <br /> The nice thing about this is that it makes American WoD look like American Urban Fantasy and European WoD look like British Urban Fantasy (I don't know about continental UF, language barriers and such). For example compare The Dresden Files where people will rationalise away blatent magic right in front of them to Rivers of London series, where just about anyone who sees magic (and plenty who've only herd rumours) will accept that Peter has magic powers.<br /> <br /> <br /> So here's how I'd split the minibooks.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>The United Kingdoms</u></b><br /> <br /> <b>War Theme</b><b>: Ungentlemanly Warfare </b><br /> <br /> Desperation is the enemy of morality, and Churchill is desperate indeed. Playing off themes of desperation and the awesome technologies developed during WWII (Colossus, RADAR) leads to the Special Operations Executive, AKA the Ministry of Ungentlemanly Warfare. Sociopathic spies seducing and assassinating their way across Europe while foiling devilish Nazi plots. Their Endowments are created from mad science and moral transgressions,<br /> <br /> <b>Civilian Theme: A Man's Home is His Castle</b><br /> <br /> The children won't go without me. I won't leave the King. And the King will never leave - Queen Elizabeth, The Queen Mother<br /> <br /> The nation is under siege. At night the Blitz begins, your home is a point of light in a perfectly dark city. Who knows what could be waiting in that darkness. Families are split up as dads go to the front lines and kids are evacuated into the country. Social changes are forced upon land by the war effort. All you can do is protect your home while the world crumbles around you.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b><u>France</u></b><br /> <br /> <b>War Theme: Paranoia and Rising From the Ashes </b><br /> <br /> France is occupied, the Germans rule and the French are split between the loyalists and the collaborators. Hunters have always depended on trust in their cell mates; the Germans have done what the monsters never could. They have broken that trust on a national scale. Yet not all is lost, Les Resistance has one powerful advantage; they hid deep in the Catacombs of Paris, and found their way deeper. From their hidden safehouses in The Underworld they strike back to spy and sabotage the Reich; the Germans dare not peruse for the dead of two world wars are legion and no friends to their killers.<br /> <br /> <b>Civilian Theme: </b>???<br /> <br /> <br /> <u><b>Russia</b></u><br /> <br /> <b>War Theme: Survival Horror</b><br /> <br /> The Eastern Front of the Great Patriotic War was the most brutal, as two of of histories most brutal dictators and some of the Earth's most unforgiving climates united against the poor soldiers and conscripts on the front line. The average Russian conscript knows he's cannon fodder, and preys to a crucifix in his right hand and some looted occult amulet or Nazi mad science in his right hand. He hears monsters howl in the woods and preys they will find the Germans first. The German soldier on the eastern front knows he's cannon fodder, and when he hears the howling he knows Mother Russia's monsters are coming for him.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile the dead are beginning to walk in their legons, and the Conspiracy that once kept them in their graves has been smashed on Stalin's orders - the Eastern Orthodox Church might have been reinstated, but their Hunters have not.<br /> <br /> <b>Civilian Theme: </b>???<br /> <br /> <br /> It's late now so I'll just quickly list the others: America was going to have a &quot;regular miliatry&quot; feel, TF:V at this point existed but had no Endowment. Germany was going to have an attitude of kill the supernaturals, steal the books, edit them to fit Nazi ideology, then start using them. Naturally this attitude was very stupid (and based on Nazi infighting), but they had their fingers in just about every pie so you can have an appropriately themed enemy project for any Hunter Conspiracy to fight. The Middle East would be outright puply, with Nazis, AKD and Indiana Jones fighting over Relics.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T10:55:45-08:00","id":53304,"title":"","content":"The Hellenistic period would be an interesting setting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1999-wolf","name":"Wolf","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1999_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"21"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-19T13:03:23-08:00","id":53396,"title":"","content":"We already have Mage for the Hellenistic period confirmed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"u